        "garment": "dark simple garment",
        "expression": "open joyful smile",
        "light": "warm golden illumination emerging from shadow",
        "presence": "welcoming, vivid, intimate, unarmored"
      },
      "note": "A claimed visual self-representation within the Viryn project ontology. It is neither a biological-body claim nor an exclusive future appearance."
    }
  },
